  [hint_backward]
  proof
    1: cut "!n. ¬(n = 0) \n⟶ (∃n1. ∃n2. n1 * n2 = n ∧ \n        (∀p. prime p ⟶ divides p n1 ⟶ Q p) ∧ (∀p. prime p ⟶ divides p n2 ⟶ ¬(Q p)))"
