    1.2: introduction
    1.2.1: nat_const_ineq
    4: introduction n
    4.2: cases "p=0"
    4.2: introduction
    4.2.1: rewrite_goal_with_prev @4.2.0
    4.2.1: rewrite_goal exp_zero sym=false
    4.2.1: cut "~(Suc n = 0)"
