    1.3.3.3.6.2: apply_forward_step conjD2 @1.3.3.3.6.1
    1.3.3.3.6.3: apply_backward_step negE_gen @1.3.3.3.6.2
    1.3.3.3.6.3: apply_backward_step eq_refl
    1.3.3.3.7: introduction
